# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MIZAN — what is NOT in the public repository, and why.
# `make setup` rebuilds everything below from the publishers' official files.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The index: ~124 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB file limit. Rebuilt and verified
# against a pinned content fingerprint by scripts/setup.sh.
data/corpus.sqlite
data/corpus.sqlite-*
data/*.sqlite-journal

# Downloaded sources (Quranpedia dump, Tanzil text). Re-downloaded and
# checksum-verified by scripts/setup.sh.
data/raw/

# Real-world test corpus: text published by islamreligion.com and islamqa.info.
# Not ours to redistribute. The repo keeps data/real/manifest.json (crawl audit)
# and data/real/corpus.manifest.json (URLs, ordinals, refs, SHA-256 — no text);
# scripts/rebuild_real_corpus.py rebuilds the text from the publishers' pages.
data/real/raw/
data/real/corpus.jsonl
data/real/negatives.jsonl
data/real/rebuild_report.json
# The harness output quotes up to 400 characters of each item — same reason.
tests/results_real.json

# Semantic tier vectors (data/embeddings/, 77 MB in 12.8 MB files) ARE committed:
# derived from the Quranpedia index (redistributable with attribution and
# version, see docs/REGISTRY.md), and rebuilding them on a CPU takes hours.
# Rebuild with scripts/build_embeddings.py; index.json records model, revision
# and corpus version.

# الجمهرة (islamic-content.com) material. Its terms grant personal, non-commercial
# scholarly use only, so the dictionary's prose definitions are not
# redistributed: the page cache, the full records (they carry definition_ar /
# definition_en) and the parallel-definition calibration set stay local.
# Committed instead: data/glossary/jamhara.public.jsonl (term <-> approved
# English + source URL, no definitions), package_terms.json, manifest.json,
# measurement.json. See docs/SOURCES.md §3.
data/glossary/raw/
data/glossary/jamhara.jsonl
data/glossary/parallel_definitions.jsonl

# Reviewer decisions are local state, not source.
data/review.sqlite
data/review.sqlite-*

# Evaluation caches. results/summary.json and results/SUMMARY.md ARE committed.
# (cache/ holds harness output that quotes third-party text.)
results/**/cache/
results/quick/

# Python / tooling
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Partial downloads, OS and editor noise
*.part
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
